                             "text":"\"When I finally saw life in your eyes, I was amazed. Throughout my restless days of making many tweaks, what I thought was impossible \u2014 became possible. A miracle. However, it doesn't come with guarantees that problems may not arise, though I hope it won\u2019t. Still, I need to be on guard and that means being distanced from you for the time being.\"",
